30 January 2026 - Dataset updated to correct minor overlapping areas and gaps between Wet Tropics and Burdekin NRM region polygons.</statement><prcStep><stepDesc>Based on 100 000 catchment boundaries with additional boundaries coming from other sources eg cyplus. </stepDesc></prcStep><prcStep><stepDesc>The Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Authority took the original dataset and clipped it to the Great Barrier Reef Catchment.  The NRM boundaries were then extended out to the boundary of the Great Barrier Reef Marine Park.</stepDesc></prcStep></dataLineage></dqInfo><spatRepInfo><VectSpatRep><geometObjs Name="NRM_Terrestrial_and_Marine_Regions_GBR_GDA2020_errorcheck"><geoObjTyp><GeoObjTypCd value="002" Sync="TRUE"/></geoObjTyp><geoObjCnt Sync="TRUE">0</geoObjCnt></geometObjs><topLvl><TopoLevCd value="001" Sync="TRUE"/></topLvl></VectSpatRep></spatRepInfo><refSysInfo><RefSystem><refSysID><identCode code="7843"/><idCodeSpace>EPSG</idCodeSpace><identVrsn>12.013</identVrsn><idVersion Sync="TRUE">8.9.4(10.5.0)</idVersion></refSysID></RefSystem></refSysInfo><distInfo><distFormat><formatName Sync="TRUE">File Geodatabase Feature Class</formatName></distFormat><distTranOps><transSize Sync="TRUE">1.340</transSize></distTranOps></distInfo><spdoinfo><ptvctinf><esriterm Name="NRM_Terrestrial_and_Marine_Regions_GBR_GDA2020_errorcheck"><efeatyp Sync="TRUE">Simple</efeatyp><efeageom code="4" Sync="TRUE"/><esritopo Sync="TRUE">FALSE</esritopo><efeacnt Sync="TRUE">0</efeacnt><spindex Sync="TRUE">TRUE</spindex><linrefer Sync="TRUE">FALSE</linrefer></esriterm></ptvctinf></spdoinfo></metadata>
